    (HERE / 'NORTHSTAR_STATUS_PROPOSAL.md').write_text("# Keep the 52 chain image and bind new sub-operations\n\nPRESENT 7 · PARTIAL 39 · REFUTED 2 · RESEARCH 3 · MISSING 1. The proposal changes **0** status lines; K16 remains MISSING. Status numbers are PHENOMENOLOGICAL planning measures.\n\n| Chains / consumer | New reviewed sub-operation | What prevents the next status |\n|---|---|---|\n| K08 / K16 / K41 / K42 , regional load and design | Conditional height response, static measurement interface and signed regional shape change | The same specimen loaded bite and independent calibrated Newton channels; physical nonlinearity/historic residue |\n| K38 / K41 / K42 / K43 , whole crown | 72 reviewed designs; spatial contact and whole anatomy gate, 0 joint PASS | Anatomy, proper preparation /passing, manufacturing and independent physical response |\n| K42/K43/K46–K48, provkontrakt | Three source facets about preload, method difference and runout | Group observations do not provide individual transfer or assembly calibration |\n\nFive of eight version entries may be used as a delimited daemon; three detachable receipts are preserved. The later completed complete crown's review is bound to its result, not to the older unfinished version. [Exact reviewhas and locators](raw/REVIEW_DELTA.json).\n\nThe source specification and the previous front page are not changed. This proposal needs independent review before it is used as new work view evidence.\n")
